# data: downloaded assets and outputs stay outside git (~/.cache/bloom).
# The ONLY committed data are the small fixtures in tests/data/ (rna_100.h5ad 2.8 MB,
# ref/rna_100_reference_embeddings.npz 1.1 MB). Everything else (gene/peak tables, the 20-cell multiome
# fixture) comes from the public bucket (docs/assets.md) and must never be committed: *.safetensors /
# *.parquet / *.npy are ignored everywhere, and pre-commit refuses files > 20 MB.
*.h5ad
!tests/data/rna_100.h5ad
*.safetensors
*.parquet
*.npy
*.npz
!tests/data/ref/rna_100_reference_embeddings.npz
*.bed.gz
*.ckpt
work/
outputs/
# notebooks
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# env-build / job logs
*.log
